507
00:47:22,190 --> 00:47:25,890
Oh our baby, we're going to miss you a lot.

508
00:47:39,130 --> 00:47:40,960
Mom.

509
00:47:43,210 --> 00:47:47,780
Grandmother Kkotnim and ahjumma... They weren't just employees working for us.

510
00:47:47,780 --> 00:47:50,490
They're practically family to us.

511
00:47:51,180 --> 00:47:56,510
Grandmother Kkotnim has been here since I was born and,

512
