544
00:51:50,160 --> 00:51:51,720
Why?

545
00:51:52,820 --> 00:51:55,690
Come to your senses, Goo Hyo Seon.

546
00:51:55,690 --> 00:52:01,570
I really beg of you to come to your senses and act at least a bit smart,

547
00:52:01,570 --> 00:52:03,760
instead of crying all day like an idiot.

548
00:52:03,760 --> 00:52:05,740
Find a way for you to live successfully,

549
00:52:05,740 --> 00:52:10,060
