553
00:52:47,360 --> 00:52:51,530
The person who killed Joon Soo's dad is you. Hyo Seon's uncle.

554
00:52:51,530 --> 00:52:54,330
W-wh-what does that mean?

555
00:52:54,330 --> 00:52:57,140
What? What is that?

556
00:52:57,140 --> 00:52:59,420
