563
00:54:05,570 --> 00:54:09,360
I'm thinking about putting all my shares of Hong Joo Ga on the market.

564
00:54:09,360 --> 00:54:11,270
What?

565
00:54:12,840 --> 00:54:15,990
I'll release my shares of Hong Joo Ga.

566
00:54:17,800 --> 00:54:22,050
Then I'll sell them and use that money to repay our debt with you.

567
00:54:22,950 --> 00:54:25,450
What do you think of that idea?

568
00:54:25,450 --> 00:54:27,850
